# --- project runtime output ------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: the corpus transcripts under tests/bench/corpus/*.md are deliberately
# COMMITTED. They are the evidence behind the prompt iterations and cost real
# YouTube requests against a rate-limited IP; they are expensive to regenerate,
# not disposable. The intermediate downloads and per-run noise are not.
tests/bench/corpus/_raw/
tests/bench/corpus/*.log
tests/bench/corpus/resolved.json
tests/bench/corpus/REPORT.md
*.log

